# ⛔ Release artifacts, built into the repo ROOT by .github/workflows/release.yml.
# Untracked and unignored, a `git add -A` in a dirty tree commits several MB of
# built binaries — including a linux ELF — into a PUBLIC repo. Ignored so that
# cannot happen by accident.
